<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border, while a separate strike wounded six people in Lebanon. Houthi forces carried out a deadly attack on Riyadh's King Khalid Airport, prompting condemnation from Damascus and a phone call between Syrian and Saudi foreign ministers to discuss regional security. Syrian security forces intensified anti-ISIS operations and pursued former regime loyalists, while private security firms clashed with a new Syrian security mogul and Syrian forces foiled drug smuggling on the Iraq and Jordan borders. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/10/uk-gaza-refugee-resettlement-scheme-palestinians-home-office&quot;&gt;theguardian.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOY0l5Q1l5cV9JdzJXNi1xY0I1R0Voenk0b01IcGVRUG5fODRyZTBid2pEVU16blFOZF82QzI4X0RTcWpJS04wdngtRTFGNHBwdDNXWDhQSjdrMkpFYmFNc3Vfa19NNWhGODk0OGs1WU1OR0NvY1RucFpBbzJaNGo3WGZIRC1EWm02TGZhUFZ0aGphUEpLXzhtOElydHVoNkJpcXlGOFVrQWJtSWhJeVBOVW1YdzhUYjdSYUtXMnEycm9JN28?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNN3VCY1RQdGx5dTRvLWZ0LTl1NnVTNXNfT3ZjYmdpbjJtN284WGM0aEFsS1pzaDdtMlFJMUlCYktTRWxhSkdWZHZuRThpN0FRWnkxNUpBSHR2ZEt0N2pmV3hhZFNKdEg5eGhfZTRUQnlqUUNLUVZkLVNNN1BCNlhmbnpJb3djR210YzJmR0dYdUtQbHRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Small Wars Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFBuMUZOeGZHY1BjS0s3ZjR2cXZvUm1GSzl6VnZIbDVzcEFUcVNydHp0aFFpdFRoVWJ5a2h6ZGVuMWpNVVNjd3N4bmhKUEg5R0UtMVhZUGUyYlo3RUw0YX